InvertedIndex.docstring:
Maps every token to the files and line numbers where it appears.

Schema (JSON):
    { "token": { "rel/path/to/file.py": [1, 14, 28] } }

discover_env_vars.docstring:
Returns (env_map, exempt_keys).
env_map: {KEY: {value, sources}}
exempt_keys: keys annotated with # ssot:exempt in .env

build_registry.docstring:
Scan the repo and build the full file registry.
Returns:
  {
    files: {rel_path: {purpose, imports, has_purpose_header}},
    dependency_graph: {module: [imported_by]},
    orphans: [files not imported by anything],
    missing_purpose: [files without FILE_PURPOSE header],
    stats: {...}
  }

